[Tips.アクリルσ@Lens_S]
effect.name=Makes transparent parts of objects appear with a frosted glass effect, blurring the background.
基準透明度=Pixels at this transparency ⇒ Acrylic background\nMore opaque ⇒ Drawn on Acrylic\nMore transparent ⇒ Semi-transparent (Anti-aliasing)
基準色=Specify when the semi-transparent part is a single color.
透過輝度=Rate of background luminance take effects
輝度補正=Adds to background luminance
透過彩度=Rate of background chroma take effects
着色=Apply color to the acrylic part.
着色輝度=Rate of tint luminance take effects
着色彩度=Rate of tint chroma take effects
noise::シード=Non-negative values generate different random for different objects even with the same seed.\nNegative values generate the same random for the same object with the same seed.
背景色=Specify when the background has transparent pixels.\nHides the unprocessed background, which is undesired to be exposed.

