[Tips.レンズσ@Lens_S]
effect.name=Generates a curved surface from the color and shape of the object, blends the background, and creates a glass block that appears to refract like a lens.
透過輝度=Rate of background luminance take effects
輝度補正=Adds to background luminance
透過彩度=Rate of background chroma take effects
表面輝度=Rate of source luminance take effects
表面彩度=Rate of source chroma take effects
背景距離=Background distance relative to the object
起伏=Overall lens undulation depth
丸み=Overall lens curve width
輪郭起伏=Undulation depth specific to the distance from the boundary of the object
輪郭丸み=Curve width specific to the distance from the boundary of the object
輝度起伏=Undulation depth specific to the luminance field
輝度丸み=Curve width specific to the luminance field
色境界起伏=Undulation depth specific to the distance from color edges
色境界丸み=Curve width specific to the distance from color edges
色境界しきい値=Threshold for detecting distance from color edges
平滑化=Increase if the shape is jagged.
色収差=Negative values will reverse the order of colors.
光角度=0 is from up, positive go clockwise.
noise::シード=Non-negative values generate different random for different objects even with the same seed.\nNegative values generate the same random for the same object with the same seed.
背景色=Specify when the background has transparent pixels.\nHides the unprocessed background, which is undesired to be exposed.
色収差順序=RGB is the correct order in the real world.
